      "text": "纯透传（不加逻辑、无 using、无 try-catch） 不要写 async/await，直接 return Task",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "R0DWefRZ54-hBE-qGx4ec",
      "originalText": "纯透传（不加逻辑、无 using、无 try-catch） 不要写 async/await，直接 return Task",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lM7pINLpBoMtQ97RrwVru",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1013.8052663638625,
      "y": 2236.022081343983,
      "width": 405,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
